  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHE Pillar 2 (Extension)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Pillar of the Sexual Health and Empowerment (SHE) project seeks to:  - Increase the organizational capacity of partner organizations and selected Women&apos;s Rights Organisations (WROs) to deliver effective programs on Sexual and Reproductive Health Rights (SRHR) and Gender Based Violence (GBV) prevention  - Strengthened capacity of WROs to generate knowledge to influence policy and practice on women&apos;s rights, particularly on SRHR and GBV prevention  - Improve the ability of WROs and networks to promote women&apos;s rights and influence policy makers on SRHR and GBV prevention</narrative>
  </description>
